Package: bionemor
Title: BioNeMo Recipes Evo 2 Workflows from R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tomasz", "Kalinowski", , "kalinowskit@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R interface to the versioned NVIDIA BioNeMo Recipes Evo 2
    workflow. Prepares MBridge checkpoints, fine-tunes models, and runs
    file-backed generation, scoring, and embedding operations through external
    local, container, or Slurm processes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/t-kalinowski/bionemor
BugReports: https://github.com/t-kalinowski/bionemor/issues
